{
  "slug": "project-notion",
  "name": "Project Notion",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "A Notion template for managing software engineering projects with an AI-assisted workflow (Claude). It provides a clean database structure (Projects → Milestones → Tasks) so you can plan work, break ideas into actionable tasks, write detailed implementation plans with acceptance criteria, and keep task status and progress synced in Notion as you build. Includes setup guidance for connecting via MCP, how to retrieve Notion Page IDs, and an end-to-end skill flow: initialize a project, brainstorm tasks, plan a task, implement a task, and update statuses.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **4 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (4): `brainstorm-notion-task` (Brainstorm and plan a new feature or project by creating multiple task pages in Notion), `implement-notion-task` (Implement a Notion task from the project defined in PROJECT-NOTION.md), `init-project-notion` (Initialize a new Notion-Claude Code integration project), `plan-notion-task` (Create a detailed task plan and write it into a Notion task page for the current project defined…)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install project-notion@claude-community` from `ArziTech/project-notion`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
